# W4-OPENING-1, stage 1 of the full opening: from the ship-start launch, select the ship, sail to the
# coast of the first island (about 550 tiles), arrive, and save. Launch:
#   --ship-start data/maps/candidates/ship-start-v2/lan5-ship-a.json --seat 0 --speed 200
wait frames 20
expect fact cities == 0
expect fact gold == 30000
expect fact generation == 0
expect fact committed == 0
screenshot 1-start
pick-ship 1
expect fact selected == 1
lookw 257 134
wait frames 20
sail 257 134
wait turns 3
expect fact latest_kind == move
wait turns 12
lookship 1
wait frames 30
screenshot 2-underway
wait fact latest == arrived within 600000
wait turns 3
expect fact ship.1.x == 257
expect fact ship.1.y == 134
expect fact cities == 0
expect fact gold == 30000
# 550 tiles of sailing rebuilt nothing of the picture.
expect fact generation == 0
expect fact committed == 0
expect fact discarded == 0
expect fact pending_builds == 0
key f5
wait fact save contains saved within 30000
quit
